    <section class="section products-section" id="products"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">SUPPLIER OPPORTUNITIES</p><h2>Specific directions with<br><em>a practical next step.</em></h2><p>These are selected supplier opportunities from Primorsky Krai and the Russian Far East. Details, documents, pricing and delivery terms are confirmed separately for each inquiry.</p></div><div class="opportunity-filters" aria-label="Filter supplier opportunities"><button class="filter-button is-active" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All opportunities</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="food" aria-pressed="false">Food</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="agriculture" aria-pressed="false">Agriculture &amp; fertilizers</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="packaging" aria-pressed="false">Packaging</button><button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter="equipment" aria-pressed="false">Vehicles &amp; equipment</button></div><div class="opportunity-grid">
      <article class="opportunity-card" data-categories="food agriculture"><div class="card-number">01 / FOOD &amp; AGRICULTURE</div><h3>Agro-Export DV</h3><p>Food ingredients and agricultural raw materials, including wheat flour, oat flakes and vegetable oils such as sunflower oil. Other products are considered when a supplier offer is confirmed.</p><div class="opportunity-meta"><span><strong>Potential buyers</strong> Food importers, distributors, bakeries, noodle and food manufacturers, HoReCa suppliers and retail distributors.</span></div><div class="tag-list"><span>Wheat flour</span><span>Oat flakes</span><span>Vegetable oils</span></div><a href="#contact" class="card-link">Request supplier details <svg class="icon"><use href="#arrow"></use></svg></a></article>
      <article class="opportunity-card" data-categories="agriculture"><div class="card-number">02 / AGRICULTURE</div><h3>Gigantin Bio</h3><p>Organic agricultural fertilizer and agricultural input from Ussuriysk Poultry Factory. The export direction has been considered; packaging options and product specifications are available upon request.</p><div class="opportunity-meta"><span><strong>Potential buyers</strong> Agricultural distributors and commercial growers.</span><span>Documents and specifications are reviewed for each inquiry.</span></div><div class="tag-list"><span>Organic input</span><span>Packaging options</span></div><a href="#contact" class="card-link">Request supplier details <svg class="icon"><use href="#arrow"></use></svg></a></article>
      <article class="opportunity-card" data-categories="agriculture"><div class="card-number">03 / AGRICULTURE</div><h3>Biotorf</h3><p>Agricultural soil improvement product and related fertilizer or agricultural input for farms and distributors, including companies working with degraded or saline soils.</p><div class="opportunity-meta"><span><strong>Potential buyers</strong> Fertilizer importers, agricultural distributors and commercial farms.</span><span>Results may vary and require independent verification under local conditions.</span></div><div class="tag-list"><span>Soil improvement</span><span>Farm input</span></div><a href="#contact" class="card-link">Request supplier details <svg class="icon"><use href="#arrow"></use></svg></a></article>
      <article class="opportunity-card" data-categories="food"><div class="card-number">04 / FOOD</div><h3>TD VIK</h3><p>Sausages, meat delicacies, frozen meat products and prepared food products for food importers, meat distributors, retail chains, HoReCa suppliers and foodservice companies.</p><div class="opportunity-meta"><span><strong>Supply review</strong> Subject to Philippine import eligibility, exporter accreditation, sanitary and veterinary requirements, English labelling and the local importer’s FDA requirements.</span></div><div class="tag-list"><span>Sausages</span><span>Frozen meat</span><span>Prepared foods</span></div><a href="#contact" class="card-link">Request supplier details <svg class="icon"><use href="#arrow"></use></svg></a></article>
      <article class="opportunity-card" data-categories="food"><div class="card-number">05 / FOOD</div><h3>Honey &amp; confectionery</h3><p>Honey, marshmallow, marmalade, mead and other confectionery products from Primorsky Krai producers Omiya and Primorsky Honey, where supplier confirmation is available.</p><div class="opportunity-meta"><span><strong>Potential buyers</strong> Food importers, specialty food distributors, retail chains, premium food channels, restaurants and HoReCa.</span></div><div class="tag-list"><span>Honey</span><span>Marshmallow</span><span>Marmalade</span></div><a href="#contact" class="card-link">Request supplier details <svg class="icon"><use href="#arrow"></use></svg></a></article>
